Subject: [PATCH 05004/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE D5
 (VERIFIER MOAT; the falsifiable GATE + DiffusionGemma-gate resolution) --
 aggregate D1/D2/D3/D4 + the cascade and DECIDE the off-ARC verifier-moat
 verdict: does >=1 oracle-distinct verifier beat the GENUINE tuned-SC with
 McNemar CI95-excl-0 on a headroom-present domain (ACCURACY), OR does the
 cascade hit parity at materially fewer judge calls (EFFICIENCY)? POSITIVE =
 moat realized off ARC + DiffusionGemma conditions satisfied on the tested
 domain (activation operator-gated). PROPERLY-EXECUTED D1 AND D2 both null =
 bounded retirement. A skeleton/degenerate arm is a FAILED execution, NOT a
 null.

